📝 LIKE OPERATOR SYNTAX
═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

Basic Syntax:
──────────
SELECT column1, column2, ...
FROM table_name
WHERE columnN LIKE pattern;

Advanced Syntax with Multiple Conditions:
────────────────────────────────────────
SELECT column1, column2, ...
FROM table_name
WHERE condition1 LIKE pattern1
  AND condition2 LIKE pattern2
   OR condition3 LIKE pattern3;

Tip: You can combine any number of conditions using AND or OR operators for
     more complex searches.


